Congratulations on making it to the Astral Plane!

Each of the high priestess is (initially) peaceful and there are
additional priests on the Astral Plane that are also (initially)
peaceful, too.

As for determining the alignment of the altars, there are a few ways
to do so:
1) stand on the altar and look ':' down.  I think this even works when
blind;
2) zap a wand of probing at the high priestess;
3) chat with the high priestess with 0 zorkmids and if co-aligned you
get "two bits for an ale";
4) killing (attacking?) the high priest will incur the wrath of
<diety> giving away the alignment (reflection is handy in this case);
5) if you receive 'sanctuary' while in the high temple and certain
monsters (consult spoilers for list of affected monsters) flee from
you, it is co-aligned;
?) I don't remember, though it happened to me yesterday, if angering
the high priest tells you his affiliation.

I am not clear on when <diety> steps in and whallops you for attacking
a high priestess, as I seem to remember Moloch shooting lightning at
me in the Sanctum and actually killing his own high priest.  But
yesterday I zapped a wand of polymorph at the High Priestess of Pshaw
and only angered the @.  It wasn't until the high priest got a death
ray that I was on the receiving end of the lightning bolt from Phat.

