just go left or right on the Astral Plane according to where I start
and wish/carry a helm of opposite alignment to reduce the length of
the tour.  Sometimes I'll even self-convert my alignment to neutral
(post-Quest!!!) so that the helm of Opp Align will make any altar
suitable (with enough remove curse/holy water).

